WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.495
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.765 --> 00:15.965
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.025 --> 00:18.965
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.035 --> 00:22.235
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.305 --> 00:25.335
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.555 --> 00:39.955
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.025 --> 00:41.455
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.525 --> 00:42.995
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:44.295 --> 00:46.325
Hey, kid. Want to play?

10
01:12.155 --> 01:13.155
Hey.

11
01:15.555 --> 01:17.095
Hey.

12
01:17.155 --> 01:18.425
Wake up. Hey.

13
01:20.365 --> 01:22.725
(Episode 3)

14
01:24.365 --> 01:26.365
I fell asleep at the worst time.

15
01:26.435 --> 01:27.735
I will head in first.

16
01:27.805 --> 01:29.905
- Okay. - I will get going.

17
01:43.915 --> 01:45.485
I think...

18
01:45.555 --> 01:49.385
she might have caught wind of your fatal flaw.

19
01:49.455 --> 01:53.595
Well, this happened because you are just too good at it.

20
01:53.665 --> 01:55.265
I mean, whenever you kiss them, the actresses...

21
01:55.325 --> 01:57.565
get weak in the knees, so how can they act?

22
01:57.635 --> 01:59.665
This is not about you, but the actresses, right?

23
01:59.735 --> 02:01.535
That is fatal.

24
02:01.605 --> 02:03.175
Okay, I will keep it a secret.

25
02:12.315 --> 02:16.285
That Female Reporter really underestimated Tae Bong and me.

26
02:16.355 --> 02:19.385
If I mention "fatal flaw" first,

27
02:19.455 --> 02:21.185
that is the signal that someone set a trap.

28
02:21.255 --> 02:23.025
But we should use that to our advantage.

29
02:30.835 --> 02:32.135
What do I do?

30
02:38.405 --> 02:39.405
Oh, that startled me.

31
02:45.115 --> 02:46.615
- Hey, Tae Bong? - Hello?

32
02:46.685 --> 02:48.315
The owner of this phone passed out...

33
02:48.385 --> 02:51.855
Wait, wait. You absolutely cannot call 911.

34
02:51.915 --> 02:53.255
Just stay right there.

35
02:53.325 --> 02:56.025
If there is any newspaper around,

36
02:56.085 --> 02:57.395
could you cover his face with it?

37
02:57.455 --> 02:59.665
No, no. Never mind. Just stay right where you are.

38
02:59.725 --> 03:01.225
Stay right there, just like that.

39
03:04.895 --> 03:07.235
Hey, Su Dong. You set up the tracker on Tae Bong's phone, right?

40
03:07.305 --> 03:08.305
Taxi!

41
03:40.865 --> 03:44.205
Stop, stop. Wait, hold on a second.

42
03:44.275 --> 03:45.275
Tae Bong!

43
03:59.455 --> 04:00.855
I knew this would happen one day.

44
04:02.085 --> 04:06.325
What am I going to do with you? Oh, man.

45
04:06.395 --> 04:08.865
Are you Sleeping Beauty or something?

46
04:09.865 --> 04:12.635
Does that make me one of the seven dwarfs? What is this?

47
04:13.705 --> 04:14.705
Darn it.

48
04:32.955 --> 04:35.525
We definitely made eye contact.

49
04:35.585 --> 04:39.895
The fact that he passed out even more after I gave him CPR means...

50
04:39.965 --> 04:42.095
Did he really faint because our lips touched?

51
04:43.435 --> 04:46.805
What is it? Did I pass on some kind of bacteria?

52
04:50.305 --> 04:51.875
If not that...

53
04:53.445 --> 04:55.305
While he lived his life completely forgetting about me,

54
04:55.375 --> 04:57.275
what really happened to him...

55
04:59.615 --> 05:01.345
What?

56
05:01.415 --> 05:02.585
I did not give him the ring.

57
05:13.195 --> 05:14.565
What? Am I home?

58
05:16.195 --> 05:18.395
(CEO Park)

59
05:25.035 --> 05:26.075
Why are you calling so early?

60
05:26.135 --> 05:29.775
My body aches from carrying you and putting you to bed, you punk.

61
05:29.845 --> 05:30.845
Did you bring me here?

62
05:30.915 --> 05:33.485
Well, who else would it be if not me? Hey.

63
05:35.245 --> 05:36.985
Anyway,

64
05:37.055 --> 05:38.455
who was that young woman last night?

65
05:43.225 --> 05:45.325
If you passed out while you two were together,

66
05:45.395 --> 05:46.595
did you two...

67
05:48.025 --> 05:49.295
do it?

68
05:49.365 --> 05:50.565
Do what?

69
05:51.865 --> 05:53.705
Why, did that woman...

70
05:55.005 --> 05:56.705
say something?

71
05:56.775 --> 05:59.405
I just assumed you had a concussion and left.

72
05:59.475 --> 06:01.175
Who is she, really?

73
06:01.245 --> 06:04.045
I do not know. She is a woman I will never see again.

74
06:04.115 --> 06:05.115
Are you sure?

75
06:06.375 --> 06:07.885
Hey, by the way,

76
06:07.945 --> 06:10.715
- this isn't you, is it? - Did you see this article?

77
06:10.785 --> 06:12.015
Yes, I am looking at it right now.

78
06:13.355 --> 06:15.085
Who is this bag man?

79
06:15.155 --> 06:16.185
Is this woman his girlfriend?

80
06:16.255 --> 06:17.825
Hey, she is definitely his girlfriend.

81
06:17.895 --> 06:18.895
What is it?

82
06:20.995 --> 06:21.995
What are you looking at?

83
06:22.065 --> 06:23.895
Hey, look at this. Is it not hilarious?

84
06:23.965 --> 06:25.065
Is he not a weirdo?

85
06:25.135 --> 06:27.165
- Look at him wearing a bag. - This is insane.

86
06:28.765 --> 06:29.775
Darn it.

87
06:33.005 --> 06:34.045
Hey, where are you going?

88
06:39.915 --> 06:42.585
It is Tae Bong no matter how you look at it.

89
06:42.645 --> 06:43.715
What should I do about this...

90
06:44.715 --> 06:47.825
What was the point of me acting my heart out to lose her last night,

91
06:47.885 --> 06:49.685
when this jerk is running around causing trouble like this?

92
06:54.195 --> 06:57.265
Wait a minute. This woman from last night...

93
06:57.335 --> 06:59.565
There is a woman I like.

94
06:59.635 --> 07:00.635
What?

95
07:02.765 --> 07:04.635
No, it cannot be.

96
07:04.705 --> 07:06.105
He said she is someone he will never see again.

97
07:07.375 --> 07:10.275
Man, how deep does this go?

98
07:18.455 --> 07:20.825
(Sports Daehan)

99
07:21.825 --> 07:24.255
What brings you to call this early in the morning?

100
07:24.325 --> 07:27.965
I called because I was worried about how your stomach is doing.

101
07:28.025 --> 07:30.095
It was burning a bit last night,

102
07:30.165 --> 07:32.735
but I received an amazing photo overnight,

103
07:32.795 --> 07:35.365
so now I feel completely relieved.

104
07:35.435 --> 07:36.505
I see.

105
07:37.805 --> 07:40.905
You must have been constipated, right?

106
07:43.215 --> 07:48.515
Anyway, the reason I called is, I saw the article you wrote,

107
07:48.585 --> 07:51.815
and I am very curious about the actor in it.

108
07:51.885 --> 07:53.425
I never wrote that it was an actor.

109
07:56.185 --> 07:58.995
- You did not. - Do not worry.

110
07:59.055 --> 08:01.825
I got a tip that it was Um Star, but I have professional ethics.

111
08:01.895 --> 08:03.835
I cannot reveal his real name without a picture of his face.

112
08:03.895 --> 08:05.865
So you do not have a picture of his face?

113
08:05.935 --> 08:08.135
But whose face is that in the picture with him?

114
08:08.205 --> 08:10.535
Is she Um Star's real hidden lover?

115
08:10.605 --> 08:12.805
Oh, what are you talking about? He has Song Na Ri.

116
08:12.875 --> 08:14.375
CEO Park, are you inside?

117
08:14.445 --> 08:16.505
I have another call coming in. Sorry.

118
08:17.545 --> 08:19.275
- What, why, why? - CEO Park?

119
08:21.315 --> 08:24.255
Did you see the article? Who is that girl in front of Tae Bong?

120
08:24.315 --> 08:26.185
What are you talking about? What do you mean, Tae Bong?

121
08:26.255 --> 08:27.725
Na Ri, our pretty Na Ri.

122
08:27.785 --> 08:29.895
Why are you coming here and throwing a fit too?

123
08:29.955 --> 08:31.425
That outfit Tae Bong is wearing,

124
08:31.495 --> 08:33.595
we bought it together when we went to Hong Kong for the shoot.

125
08:33.665 --> 08:35.765
I am going to destroy Um Tae Bong.

126
08:36.835 --> 08:39.035
I am sorry. I am so embarrassed. Come out quickly.

127
08:39.095 --> 08:40.235
Just wait and see.

128
08:40.305 --> 08:42.235
You will see if I can seduce him or not.

129
08:49.475 --> 08:51.745
Why did they buy clothes together?

130
08:52.945 --> 08:55.585
What sin did I commit in my past life?

131
09:06.255 --> 09:07.995
She really does not know,

132
09:09.395 --> 09:10.435
right?

133
09:13.335 --> 09:16.535
Wow, this one and this one too. They look really warm.

134
09:16.605 --> 09:19.975
Wow, where did you get all of these?

135
09:20.045 --> 09:22.675
I am the head of our neighbourhood.

136
09:22.745 --> 09:25.915
I went around and told people to make some donations.

137
09:25.975 --> 09:28.245
I will definitely repay this favour too.

138
09:29.645 --> 09:33.085
But why is this one not working? Are the batteries dead?

139
09:37.055 --> 09:39.395
- It has some. - What? How do you know that?

140
09:39.455 --> 09:42.265
If there is battery left, the tip of your tongue...

141
09:45.635 --> 09:46.935
tingles.

142
09:49.065 --> 09:50.575
Do you want to try?

143
09:50.635 --> 09:51.635
Yes.

144
10:02.145 --> 10:04.855
Yes, I guess that is what a first kiss is like.

145
10:09.025 --> 10:13.125
It tingles just like electricity.

146
10:17.265 --> 10:22.435
Oh my, she sucked on the battery and lost her mind.

147
10:22.505 --> 10:27.145
Did you have your first kiss last night or something?

148
10:27.205 --> 10:30.975
What? What first kiss?

149
10:49.495 --> 10:52.195
Look at you getting all nervous.

150
10:52.265 --> 10:55.405
I told you I would teach you how to kiss.

151
11:04.275 --> 11:06.915
I am a total pro,

152
11:06.985 --> 11:08.615
so why did I act like that yesterday?

153
11:09.745 --> 11:13.115
I had never felt that way before.

154
11:15.555 --> 11:17.825
Oh, right. That actor, Um Tae Bong.

155
11:17.895 --> 11:19.655
Why does he really refuse to film kiss scenes?

156
11:19.725 --> 11:23.295
How should I know? But there is something.

157
11:23.365 --> 11:25.195
A deep backstory.

158
11:25.265 --> 11:26.935
There really is something going on.

159
11:28.235 --> 11:29.605
Is that why he looked a bit lonely?

160
11:34.075 --> 11:37.645
Stop sucking on that. Now get up, get up, okay?

161
11:37.715 --> 11:38.745
And take this.

162
11:43.615 --> 11:47.325
It will soon be the 29.

163
11:47.385 --> 11:48.625
Why? What day is that?

164
11:49.785 --> 11:51.355
The day I meet my dad.

165
11:56.495 --> 11:57.935
Excuse me.

166
11:57.995 --> 12:00.665
Do you happen to know where this customer went?

167
12:00.735 --> 12:03.335
No idea. We just check them out and that is it.

168
12:06.675 --> 12:10.215
So, are the promotions for the new car coming along well?

169
12:10.275 --> 12:13.145
Yes. For the TV commercials, we plan to highlight the brand's value...

170
12:13.215 --> 12:16.115
and stimulate the desire to purchase through emotional storytelling.

171
12:16.185 --> 12:17.885
Good.

172
12:17.955 --> 12:19.185
What does everyone else think?

173
12:19.255 --> 12:20.685
- Sounds good. - I like it.

174
12:20.755 --> 12:21.755
Okay.

175
12:22.825 --> 12:27.195
Anyway, the shareholders' meeting is soon, so how is Chairman Wang?

176
12:31.435 --> 12:33.765
It is nothing for you all to worry about.

177
12:33.835 --> 12:35.735
Why would we be worried?

178
12:35.805 --> 12:38.705
We just thought you would have a lot on your mind, Chairman Oh.

179
12:38.775 --> 12:42.445
Does this look like the place for such personal concerns?

180
12:50.655 --> 12:51.655
It is a call from Manager Nam Goong.

181
12:51.715 --> 12:54.055
- Later. - He says it is urgent.

182
12:57.025 --> 12:58.055
Let us wrap up for today.

183
13:08.535 --> 13:10.875
What is going on that he is telling us to leave?

184
13:12.335 --> 13:14.675
If it were not for his late wife,

185
13:14.745 --> 13:17.845
would Chairman Oh even be sitting in that seat?

186
13:17.915 --> 13:20.245
You know how Chairman Wang is.

187
13:20.315 --> 13:21.785
You know, right?

188
13:21.845 --> 13:24.215
The real owner of this company. The man sitting over there...

189
13:24.285 --> 13:27.185
looking so important is his father-in-law.

190
13:27.255 --> 13:28.255
Yes.

191
13:29.725 --> 13:32.255
Chairman Wang is incredible.

192
13:32.325 --> 13:33.665
He is absolutely determined...

193
13:33.725 --> 13:35.195
not to give the company to his son-in-law.

194
13:35.265 --> 13:36.995
He just put him in that position,

195
13:37.065 --> 13:38.265
but he made sure his daughter's shares...

196
13:38.335 --> 13:40.035
went to his granddaughter...

197
13:40.095 --> 13:41.635
and made it so Chairman Oh cannot touch them.

198
13:41.705 --> 13:45.535
Does that not say it all? But that heiress...

199
13:45.605 --> 13:48.845
- is too shrouded in mystery. - It makes sense.

200
13:50.075 --> 13:51.945
A young child went through something like that.

201
13:55.915 --> 13:57.385
The young lady's whereabouts are still...

202
14:04.595 --> 14:06.495
What are you doing?

203
14:06.555 --> 14:07.895
The executives are right outside.

204
14:07.965 --> 14:09.695
Do you think he does not have ears here?

205
14:09.765 --> 14:10.795
I think something might have happened...

206
14:10.865 --> 14:12.565
to the young lady.

207
14:13.835 --> 14:18.135
- Did you find her? - We found the young lady on CCTV.

208
14:18.205 --> 14:20.275
But she looks different from usual...

209
14:20.345 --> 14:22.605
Is it anything new for her to be strange?

210
14:22.675 --> 14:24.015
Get rid of the CCTV footage...

211
14:24.075 --> 14:25.345
and find her without starting any rumours.

212
14:38.255 --> 14:40.265
(Taekwondo)

213
15:05.015 --> 15:06.455
Darn it.

214
15:09.455 --> 15:10.725
Let's have a match.

215
15:13.555 --> 15:15.225
Are you sure you have a certificate?

216
15:15.295 --> 15:16.695
Someone who can't even do a basic kick,

217
15:16.765 --> 15:18.295
how can I hire you?

218
15:18.365 --> 15:20.765
Has my body gotten too stiff?

219
15:20.835 --> 15:22.335
What is seriously wrong with me?

220
15:45.225 --> 15:46.295
Are we done here?

221
15:54.035 --> 15:57.135
Hey, I have a question for you.

222
15:58.635 --> 15:59.835
About last night.

223
16:00.975 --> 16:03.345
I mean, you and me...

224
16:04.975 --> 16:05.975
By any chance...

225
16:10.585 --> 16:11.685
Are you listening to me?

226
16:12.955 --> 16:15.385
- It was electrifying. - Hey.

227
16:15.455 --> 16:18.025
You startled me. Why are you yelling?

228
16:18.095 --> 16:19.355
You used to just boss people around,

229
16:19.425 --> 16:20.925
but did becoming an actor make you even grumpier?

230
16:20.995 --> 16:23.395
For someone who became so successful,

231
16:23.465 --> 16:25.495
why did the look in your eyes change so much?

232
16:25.565 --> 16:27.465
What do you mean, change?

233
16:27.535 --> 16:28.535
Since when do we know each other?

234
16:28.605 --> 16:30.205
You have the loneliest eyes in the world.

235
16:31.335 --> 16:33.105
Did you not know?

236
16:33.175 --> 16:34.245
That is how your eyes look.

237
16:40.585 --> 16:42.785
- No, they do not. - Yes, they do.

238
16:48.225 --> 16:51.525
So what is it? You said you had a question.

239
16:51.595 --> 16:54.165
I mean, by any chance, last night,

240
16:54.225 --> 16:57.365
was I acting a little strange or...

241
16:57.435 --> 16:58.765
Is it because you passed out?

242
16:59.835 --> 17:01.465
I think it happened when you fell.

243
17:01.535 --> 17:04.005
- Is your head okay? - Right, from falling.

244
17:04.075 --> 17:05.705
Is there nothing else?

245
17:05.775 --> 17:08.775
Oh, that? That weird...

246
17:17.685 --> 17:19.085
Yes.

247
17:19.155 --> 17:21.525
You are talking about your Adam's apple, right?

248
17:21.585 --> 17:23.255
Your Adam's apple is really big.

249
17:24.625 --> 17:26.925
- My Adam's apple? - Yes.

250
17:26.995 --> 17:28.125
My Adam's apple is really big.

251
17:29.325 --> 17:30.595
We will never see each other again anyway.

252
17:31.595 --> 17:32.595
So get going.

253
17:34.665 --> 17:35.665
Adam's apple.

254
17:39.535 --> 17:42.275
Do not worry.

255
17:42.345 --> 17:43.405
I will absolutely never...

256
17:44.445 --> 17:45.445
tell anyone.

257
17:45.515 --> 17:49.045
Oh my, my bag, someone catch him.

258
17:49.115 --> 17:50.115
Oh my.

259
17:51.455 --> 17:52.815
Oh my, someone catch him.

260
18:02.825 --> 18:04.735
What? Why are you following me?

261
18:04.795 --> 18:05.865
Just catch him first.

262
18:44.135 --> 18:45.575
You startled me.

263
18:45.635 --> 18:48.105
- Who are you? - Just give the bag back.

264
18:48.175 --> 18:50.305
Then I will let you go.

265
18:50.375 --> 18:52.515
What? Move, you will get hurt.

266
18:55.485 --> 18:57.015
Hey, move, I am busy.

267
19:00.115 --> 19:01.625
What? Let go.

268
19:01.685 --> 19:04.495
Please let my old skills come back.

269
19:06.455 --> 19:07.465
Darn it.

270
19:10.935 --> 19:13.595
Man. I swear, darn it.

271
19:51.505 --> 19:53.505
(Police)

272
19:56.775 --> 20:00.515
You are truly amazing. And with your bare hands, too.

273
20:00.585 --> 20:02.385
It was not me...

274
20:02.445 --> 20:03.445
it was her.

275
20:04.555 --> 20:06.815
You must have done some martial arts.

276
20:06.885 --> 20:07.885
Well,

277
20:07.955 --> 20:09.585
a little bit of Hapkido and Taekwondo.

278
20:09.655 --> 20:10.955
Um Tae Bong, you too,

279
20:11.025 --> 20:13.795
caught a bad guy all by yourself before.

280
20:13.855 --> 20:15.965
I have been a huge fan since then.

281
20:17.165 --> 20:18.395
- Yes. - Well, I'll be going now.

282
20:20.465 --> 20:21.505
Let us go.

283
20:31.175 --> 20:33.375
Did you catch a bad guy before, too?

284
20:33.445 --> 20:34.445
All by yourself?

285
20:36.015 --> 20:37.855
That is pretty cool.

286
20:37.915 --> 20:39.955
Why are you so eager to protect people?

287
20:40.015 --> 20:41.885
Fearlessly jumping in all the time.

288
20:41.955 --> 20:44.255
It is an occupational hazard. Why?

289
20:44.325 --> 20:46.495
Keep up the good work...

290
20:46.555 --> 20:48.425
and let us never cross paths again.

291
20:50.835 --> 20:53.895
Wow. Why the sudden temper?

292
20:56.835 --> 20:58.335
Goodbye,

293
20:58.405 --> 20:59.435
Han Jung Woo.

294
21:06.545 --> 21:08.285
(No Caller ID)

295
21:11.085 --> 21:12.085
Hello.

296
21:12.155 --> 21:15.625
You still love playing the hero, just like the old days.

297
21:15.685 --> 21:18.795
- Who are you? - Well,

298
21:18.855 --> 21:21.025
- who could I be? - Was it you?

299
21:21.095 --> 21:22.165
In the underground parking lot.

300
21:23.395 --> 21:25.895
- Who on earth are you? - Um Tae Bong.

301
21:25.965 --> 21:27.605
We will meet again soon.

302
21:33.105 --> 21:34.605
That area is a blind spot for the security cameras,

303
21:34.675 --> 21:36.745
so it is hard to identify a suspect,

304
21:36.805 --> 21:38.245
and we did not find any fingerprints on the brick.

305
21:39.815 --> 21:41.815
Yes, I understand. Then,

306
21:41.885 --> 21:43.885
please contact me if you find anything.

307
21:47.825 --> 21:51.525
Do you really not remember his face? Hey, he altered his voice,

308
21:51.595 --> 21:54.195
and it means he was watching you earlier.

309
21:54.265 --> 21:55.325
Hey, do not worry.

310
21:56.425 --> 22:00.765
For now, I will make a list of guys...

311
22:00.835 --> 22:02.305
who might hold a grudge against you.

312
22:02.365 --> 22:05.875
First, Go Tae Sik, who lost the lead role to you last year.

313
22:05.935 --> 22:07.075
I heard his family is struggling,

314
22:07.135 --> 22:08.475
so he tried to get a big paycheck at once,

315
22:08.545 --> 22:11.175
but it fell through because of you. Do you think he holds a grudge?

316
22:11.245 --> 22:12.945
It is not him. Because of my bad rumours,

317
22:13.015 --> 22:14.415
he got the role in the movie I was fired from.

318
22:14.485 --> 22:15.485
That is right.

319
22:15.545 --> 22:18.855
Some jerk spread rumours that Um Tae Bong has a terrible temper.

320
22:18.915 --> 22:21.355
How did you know that? Were you that jerk?

321
22:21.425 --> 22:23.325
To get him that role?

322
22:23.385 --> 22:25.855
Hey, do you know how much the pay was?

323
22:25.925 --> 22:27.095
You are unbelievable.

324
22:28.665 --> 22:31.135
Or maybe her, the one who got famous from fake dating you...

325
22:31.195 --> 22:32.465
but lost popularity after you dumped her.

326
22:32.535 --> 22:35.035
What was her name again? Ms. P.

327
22:35.105 --> 22:36.505
Or Director Kim,

328
22:36.505 --> 22:39.005
who takes blood pressure pills because of you.

329
22:39.075 --> 22:42.575
He used to be very successful. His works had a lot of catchphrases.

330
22:42.645 --> 22:46.315
"I am a pushover." You probably do not know.

331
22:46.375 --> 22:48.485
I think he married the actress from that project.

332
22:48.545 --> 22:49.545
And now, a man like him...

333
22:49.615 --> 22:50.985
is taking blood pressure medication because of you.

334
22:51.055 --> 22:52.415
Or recently,

335
22:52.485 --> 22:53.955
Na Ri. After the dating rumours with you,

336
22:54.015 --> 22:55.925
she lost a lot of her older male fans.

337
22:55.985 --> 22:57.925
How long do we have to do this? All night?

338
22:57.995 --> 22:59.525
Then I should have brought my pyjamas.

339
22:59.595 --> 23:02.165
If you had behaved better, would this list be endless?

340
23:03.965 --> 23:06.235
Anyway, if he managed to find out your number,

341
23:06.295 --> 23:09.265
he is a very scary guy. First, change your number.

342
23:09.335 --> 23:14.145
No, they will definitely call again. If I want to track this jerk down,

343
23:14.205 --> 23:15.305
this is the only way.

344
23:15.375 --> 23:17.105
Hey, are you just going to sit back and wait for a call?

345
23:17.175 --> 23:20.315
Do not answer that unknown number again when you are alone.

346
23:20.375 --> 23:21.945
Tae Bong,

347
23:22.015 --> 23:23.485
let us get you a bodyguard.

348
23:24.485 --> 23:25.955
Darn it.

349
23:26.015 --> 23:28.385
- Are you saying that again? - I mean,

350
23:29.585 --> 23:32.525
we should get you a secret bodyguard.

351
23:32.595 --> 23:34.625
A secret...

352
23:34.695 --> 23:35.725
bodyguard?

353
23:37.765 --> 23:39.865
Why are you so desperate to protect people?

354
23:41.235 --> 23:44.475
His temper has gotten even worse.

355
23:45.705 --> 23:48.075
I do not know why I am like this either.

356
23:52.145 --> 23:55.245
What? His back looks a lot like Jung Woo.

357
23:57.185 --> 23:59.355
- What? - Hey.

358
24:01.755 --> 24:03.055
We ended up having dinner together.

359
24:07.795 --> 24:09.825
I was actually thinking about you earlier.

360
24:09.895 --> 24:12.765
But then you appeared right in front of me.

361
24:14.065 --> 24:15.765
My heart almost stopped.

362
24:26.215 --> 24:28.315
- It is spicy. - Is it spicy?

363
24:29.685 --> 24:32.255
Should I not have bought it? I just missed this taste.

364
24:38.595 --> 24:41.425
I really thought my tongue was burning.

365
24:41.495 --> 24:44.335
This is strange. I am a huge fan of tteokbokki,

366
24:44.395 --> 24:46.065
so why does it feel like I am eating it for the first time?

367
24:47.635 --> 24:49.335
By the way,

368
24:49.405 --> 24:51.005
are you really the person in the room next to mine?

369
24:53.475 --> 24:54.775
Yes, why?

370
24:55.975 --> 24:57.105
Because I am so happy.

371
24:59.645 --> 25:00.645
Could it be...

372
25:01.815 --> 25:03.045
as much as me?

373
25:09.255 --> 25:10.255
Hurry up and eat.

374
25:51.965 --> 25:52.965
Who...

375
25:54.035 --> 25:55.205
are you exactly?

376
26:05.575 --> 26:06.575
Good luck.

377
26:12.215 --> 26:14.285
(Part-Time Worker Wanted, Hours Negotiable, Feel Free To Inquire)

378
26:15.755 --> 26:17.385
Excuse me.

379
26:17.455 --> 26:19.125
- Are you the owner? - Yes.

380
26:19.125 --> 26:21.765
I'm Cha Hong Du. If you give me a task,

381
26:21.825 --> 26:23.095
I am confident I can do it well.

382
26:24.295 --> 26:26.995
These are my steel forearms built from part-time jobs.

383
26:27.065 --> 26:29.665
- What did you say? - All I have is stamina and guts.

384
26:29.735 --> 26:30.975
I will be your best employee.

385
26:31.035 --> 26:32.075
It is okay, we already hired someone.

386
26:32.135 --> 26:33.135
We already found someone.

387
26:33.135 --> 26:34.545
I will be your best...

388
26:40.715 --> 26:42.615
Yes, I understand.

389
26:47.255 --> 26:48.285
It is Jung Woo.

390
26:51.495 --> 26:54.565
- Where are you going? - I am going to work.

391
26:54.625 --> 26:55.695
But what are you doing here?

392
26:57.325 --> 27:00.065
Looking for a part-time job. But I have not found one yet.

393
27:01.735 --> 27:06.435
Oh, a bicycle. I am also good at...

394
27:07.605 --> 27:09.405
riding. Am I?

395
27:10.905 --> 27:13.315
Why do I not have any memory of riding a bicycle?

396
27:15.645 --> 27:17.515
Then...

397
27:17.585 --> 27:18.785
should I teach you?

398
27:20.085 --> 27:21.085
Really?

399
27:22.225 --> 27:23.985
I will see you at the park at three o'clock on Saturday.

400
27:26.095 --> 27:28.795
What? Really?

401
27:34.365 --> 27:37.935
Anyway. My stamina is terrible,

402
27:38.005 --> 27:41.445
my strength is terrible, and my kicks are terrible.

403
27:42.445 --> 27:44.645
Everything went down the drain in three years.

404
27:47.015 --> 27:50.015
Gosh, I have to pay rent, too.

405
27:50.085 --> 27:52.285
Should I blackmail that jerk with his secret?

406
27:55.455 --> 27:57.255
No, no.

407
27:57.325 --> 27:59.455
Let's not be that kind of pathetic person.

408
28:06.435 --> 28:08.165
Have we met before?

409
28:12.475 --> 28:14.745
He has changed a lot.

410
28:14.805 --> 28:16.375
Then again,

411
28:16.445 --> 28:18.975
his name is not even Han Jung Woo anymore,

412
28:19.045 --> 28:20.645
so his tastes must have changed, too.

413
28:24.885 --> 28:28.185
Why did he recommend someone like her?

414
28:28.255 --> 28:29.985
He said they would never see each other again.

415
28:34.565 --> 28:36.125
Come here and sit down.

416
28:36.195 --> 28:37.495
Here, right here.

417
28:47.805 --> 28:51.945
There is a saying in this world. Keep your enemies close...

418
28:52.015 --> 28:53.445
and keep those who might be your enemies...

419
28:53.515 --> 28:56.085
even closer.

420
28:56.145 --> 28:57.715
What are you talking about?

421
28:57.785 --> 28:59.485
Anyway,

422
28:59.555 --> 29:02.925
I saw you use your body quite well last time.

423
29:02.985 --> 29:04.855
Did you actually work out?

424
29:04.925 --> 29:05.925
Yes, a little.

425
29:05.995 --> 29:07.395
Taekwondo rank 3 and Hapkido rank 2.

426
29:07.455 --> 29:09.695
Wow, you will not get beaten up with her around.

427
29:09.765 --> 29:14.195
Let us say someone has a secret. Like a weakness.

428
29:14.265 --> 29:15.905
What would you do if you found out about it?

429
29:18.735 --> 29:20.905
Would they give me money? How much would they give me?

430
29:22.075 --> 29:23.775
It depends on the amount.

431
29:25.515 --> 29:29.045
She has great capitalistic genes, right? She is my type.

432
29:29.115 --> 29:31.385
- We have a connection here. - Last question.

433
29:31.455 --> 29:34.725
I will ask you directly. Do you like me?

434
29:37.585 --> 29:38.855
Have you completely lost your mind?

435
29:38.925 --> 29:41.795
Bravo. That is it. You pass.

436
29:43.825 --> 29:45.595
What are you doing after calling me all the way here?

437
29:45.665 --> 29:48.665
Passed with top honours. Now, right here.

438
29:48.735 --> 29:51.205
You just need to sign here.

439
29:51.805 --> 29:52.835
(Contract)

440
29:52.905 --> 29:56.945
It is an employment contract. To hire you as my bodyguard.

441
29:57.005 --> 29:58.515
The pay is 2,300 dollars a month.

442
29:58.575 --> 30:02.245
You must accompany our actor Um Tae Bong on his schedule at all times.

443
30:02.315 --> 30:03.915
However,

444
30:03.985 --> 30:07.415
the fact that you are Tae Bong's bodyguard...

445
30:07.485 --> 30:09.525
is an absolute secret.

446
30:14.995 --> 30:16.025
One more thing.

447
30:18.095 --> 30:19.135
That night.

448
30:24.105 --> 30:26.675
Did you really not notice...

449
30:26.735 --> 30:28.475
anything strange about me?

450
30:35.645 --> 30:37.045
I did not.

451
30:37.115 --> 30:39.815
Of course you did not.

452
30:39.885 --> 30:44.795
But keep this in mind. The contract with me is an absolute secret.

453
30:44.855 --> 30:46.955
- I know. - Do not forget.

454
30:47.025 --> 30:50.625
If you break it, you will pay a massive price.

455
30:50.695 --> 30:54.295
I get it, and if it is about protecting you,

456
30:54.365 --> 30:56.635
I will even risk my life.

457
30:56.705 --> 30:57.905
On that note...

458
30:59.235 --> 31:01.945
could you possibly give me some of the money in advance?

459
31:02.005 --> 31:05.545
Oh, of course, I knew you would say that,

460
31:05.615 --> 31:06.975
so I prepared a 50 percent advance.

461
31:07.045 --> 31:10.045
Here, take it. Your social security number...

462
31:10.115 --> 31:11.715
Hand over your ID card first.

463
31:11.785 --> 31:13.855
Because identity verification is required.

464
31:13.915 --> 31:15.355
My ID card?

465
31:17.325 --> 31:19.455
Well...

466
31:19.525 --> 31:22.195
I think I might have lost it, and this is...

467
31:22.265 --> 31:25.365
Then just the number, what is your number...

468
31:25.435 --> 31:27.895
My Social Security number is...

469
31:31.305 --> 31:32.975
(Cha Hong Du Life Record)

470
31:33.035 --> 31:35.045
(Date of Birth: 950704-29...)

471
31:35.105 --> 31:37.175
Ninety-five...

472
31:37.245 --> 31:38.945
What, 95?

473
31:39.015 --> 31:41.415
Someone born in 1995 has spoken informally to me this whole time?

474
31:41.485 --> 31:42.485
You.

475
31:42.545 --> 31:45.585
- Call me "sir" from now on. - No.

476
31:45.655 --> 31:46.655
I've talked casually for so long...

477
31:46.715 --> 31:47.985
do you think I can change that overnight?

478
31:48.055 --> 31:49.455
When exactly did we...

479
31:51.595 --> 31:52.595
For a long time?

480
31:54.665 --> 31:56.395
Fine. Just sign it quickly.

481
32:00.995 --> 32:03.035
(Cha Hong Du)

482
32:10.875 --> 32:12.615
Keep this in mind.

483
32:12.675 --> 32:15.715
I have your face right here. If you breach the contract,

484
32:15.785 --> 32:17.445
I will broadcast it all over the country that very day.

485
32:17.515 --> 32:19.185
I get it, I get it.

486
32:19.185 --> 32:22.855
So, what should I do first?

487
32:24.485 --> 32:25.655
Do not tell me...

488
32:25.725 --> 32:28.595
you are going to be my bodyguard looking like that?

489
32:41.235 --> 32:43.705
- What is wrong with it? - Are you filming Men in Black?

490
32:43.775 --> 32:44.775
Why?

491
32:44.845 --> 32:47.545
You might as well write "bodyguard" on your forehead.

492
32:47.615 --> 32:48.915
I saw at the market...

493
32:48.985 --> 32:50.645
they were selling hats that said "bodyguard."

494
32:50.715 --> 32:52.585
- Should I buy one and wear it? - Hey.

495
32:54.455 --> 32:56.625
You are my secret bodyguard.

496
32:56.685 --> 32:58.655
Then what kind of clothes am I supposed to wear?

497
32:58.725 --> 32:59.725
Here,

498
32:59.795 --> 33:02.325
it is best to dress like this so it is not obvious you are a bodyguard.

499
33:02.395 --> 33:04.995
I will introduce you to people as the new stylist.

500
33:05.065 --> 33:06.935
- My assistant. - Yes.

501
33:06.995 --> 33:08.635
He might seem a bit prickly on the outside,

502
33:08.705 --> 33:10.405
but on the inside...

503
33:10.465 --> 33:11.505
he is even more prickly.

504
33:11.575 --> 33:13.075
So it is going to be very difficult for you from now on.

505
33:13.135 --> 33:15.875
When he gets annoyed, just think about something else.

506
33:15.945 --> 33:19.515
- Then the time will fly by. - Yes. I will work hard from now on.

507
33:21.175 --> 33:23.685
Do I pay your salary? Well, I work hard too.

508
33:23.745 --> 33:24.955
Change your clothes and come out.

509
33:28.885 --> 33:30.985
She is so cool.

510
33:31.055 --> 33:32.625
She is exactly my style.

511
33:42.565 --> 33:44.305
Hey, you, rookie.

512
33:46.005 --> 33:47.005
Come on.

513
33:51.445 --> 33:53.315
Are you...

514
33:53.375 --> 33:54.915
Are you really here as a bodyguard?

515
33:54.985 --> 33:56.845
I think so?

516
33:56.915 --> 33:58.785
You are not here as the new manager?

517
33:58.855 --> 34:00.315
I do not think so?

518
34:00.385 --> 34:03.155
Come on. Don't you know how to use honorifics?

519
34:03.225 --> 34:04.995
From now on, at the end of everything this senior says,

520
34:05.055 --> 34:08.095
you must always use honorifics. Got it?

521
34:08.165 --> 34:09.165
Got it.

522
34:11.095 --> 34:12.995
I understand, sir.

523
34:14.335 --> 34:16.265
Well, if you are a bodyguard, really...

524
34:16.335 --> 34:19.235
- Are you good at fighting? - Taekwondo,

525
34:19.305 --> 34:22.045
Kendo, Judo.

526
34:23.305 --> 34:25.275
Oh, what else is there...

527
34:26.845 --> 34:27.845
Even so, kid.

528
34:27.915 --> 34:31.385
Experience is everything. You are at the bottom, got it?

529
34:31.455 --> 34:34.215
- I understand. - That is right, "I understand."

530
34:34.285 --> 34:35.285
Let's go.

531
34:36.825 --> 34:38.525
He is...

532
34:39.695 --> 34:44.425
so honest. He is exactly my type, too.

533
34:45.495 --> 34:47.995
Hello. I am Cha Hong Du.

534
34:48.065 --> 34:50.005
- Look forward to working with you. - Yes.

535
34:50.065 --> 34:52.805
She is our new youngest stylist. This is our director.

536
34:52.875 --> 34:54.635
His directing skills are the best in the industry.

537
34:54.705 --> 34:59.045
Oh, come on, not the best. But your name is Cha Hong Du?

538
34:59.115 --> 35:02.145
Then is your older sister Gil Ra Im, and your younger sister Dong Baek?

539
35:08.085 --> 35:09.185
No, they are not.

540
35:10.225 --> 35:11.455
Wait, but...

541
35:11.525 --> 35:13.255
Aren't you the one who barged onto the set last time...

542
35:13.325 --> 35:15.565
that fan of Um Star?

543
35:15.625 --> 35:17.065
Anyway,

544
35:17.125 --> 35:18.935
how old are you, Hong Du?

545
35:18.995 --> 35:22.035
- I am 28 years old. - Wow, you look young for your age.

546
35:22.105 --> 35:23.565
I thought you were 27.

547
35:27.705 --> 35:31.915
Unbelievable. Smiling at just anyone.

548
35:31.975 --> 35:34.675
She only frowns at me, seriously.

549
35:34.745 --> 35:37.515
- Who? Who only frowns at you? - Oh, you startled me.

550
35:37.585 --> 35:41.015
Oh, Director. Your jokes are the best in the industry, too.

551
35:41.085 --> 35:42.925
But who is that?

552
35:42.985 --> 35:45.595
- I have never seen her before. - The new stylist.

553
35:47.095 --> 35:50.025
But she looks like a total country bumpkin.

554
35:50.095 --> 35:52.335
Is she really a stylist?

555
35:52.395 --> 35:53.665
Hurry up and get ready.

556
35:55.935 --> 35:58.065
She was at the park with you...

557
35:59.205 --> 36:02.145
What the? Where did he go?

558
36:02.205 --> 36:03.605
Darn it.

559
36:11.215 --> 36:12.215
Hey, Su Dong.

560
36:16.055 --> 36:18.125
What? Do you need to poop?

561
36:19.255 --> 36:21.425
Where did you buy that sandwich earlier?

562
36:21.495 --> 36:23.825
I should report them to the FDA. I really should.

563
36:23.895 --> 36:25.095
Are you really holding in your poop?

564
36:25.165 --> 36:26.765
Stop talking to me.

565
36:29.435 --> 36:31.675
The restroom is right there.

566
36:31.735 --> 36:33.635
What if I go alone and run into someone suspicious?

567
36:35.175 --> 36:36.905
I am going to hold it until Su Dong gets here.

568
36:38.045 --> 36:40.615
Go. Hey, I will go with you.

569
36:40.675 --> 36:42.085
I am your bodyguard, after all.

570
36:42.145 --> 36:44.485
Are you crazy? Why would you follow me? Darn it.

571
36:44.545 --> 36:46.015
Forget it. I will just go by myself.

572
36:47.815 --> 36:49.155
I am going to take a dump.

573
37:26.855 --> 37:28.125
That feels better.

574
37:30.125 --> 37:33.035
- Why did you come in here? - Are you okay? Is everything fine?

575
37:33.095 --> 37:34.435
What about the man who just came in?

576
37:35.935 --> 37:37.635
What man?

577
37:37.705 --> 37:39.975
I definitely saw him. A suspicious man.

578
37:43.475 --> 37:46.015
Great job.

579
37:46.075 --> 37:48.415
- Get out right now. - I really saw him.

580
37:48.485 --> 37:49.585
Get out, hurry.

581
37:52.715 --> 37:54.515
Come in. Hurry.

582
38:07.735 --> 38:11.235
The stalker is singing now? Letting me know you are here.

583
38:12.375 --> 38:14.235
We both look like total perverts, right?

584
38:15.475 --> 38:17.705
The cover-up operation.

585
38:17.775 --> 38:18.875
You...

586
38:18.945 --> 38:20.615
protect me.

587
38:20.675 --> 38:21.785
Because I...

588
38:23.485 --> 38:24.815
will protect myself, too.

589
38:46.635 --> 38:49.345
I am sorry. Oh, come on.

590
38:50.375 --> 38:51.945
Is he crazy or what?

591
38:56.545 --> 38:59.515
Crazy lunatics. Just wait until I catch you.

592
39:00.715 --> 39:02.785
But that outfit looks really familiar.

593
39:03.785 --> 39:05.355
Is it the same one you wore earlier?

594
39:07.795 --> 39:09.465
It is different. I am sure.

595
39:09.525 --> 39:11.735
I have never seen such a different design in my life.

596
39:14.295 --> 39:15.935
Just throw it away and forget about it.

597
39:17.805 --> 39:19.435
This is all your fault.

598
39:19.505 --> 39:21.205
Why did you come into the men's room?

599
39:22.575 --> 39:25.475
I only went in because I was worried about you.

600
39:25.545 --> 39:27.345
You petty jerk.

601
39:27.415 --> 39:28.415
Petty?

602
39:30.545 --> 39:32.855
Why you little.

603
39:32.915 --> 39:36.125
- Our contract is cancelled. - What?

604
39:36.185 --> 39:37.585
Then what about my promised salary?

605
39:37.655 --> 39:40.155
- What about my rent from now on? - Why should I care?

606
39:41.625 --> 39:43.665
If you fire me,

607
39:43.725 --> 39:46.165
I will expose all your secrets.

608
39:50.605 --> 39:51.605
What secrets?

609
39:54.775 --> 39:56.745
Everyone, you know Um Tae Bong, right?

610
39:56.805 --> 39:58.275
Actually, earlier today, Um Tae Bong...

611
39:58.345 --> 40:00.445
took a massive dump.

612
40:02.985 --> 40:03.985
Darn it.

613
40:08.825 --> 40:11.525
When did I ever take a massive dump...

614
40:13.625 --> 40:17.295
Exposing someone's secret? With no manners?

615
40:17.365 --> 40:20.965
You have zero public decency. Right, guys?

616
40:23.565 --> 40:26.535
If you threaten me with my secrets one more time, then...

617
40:26.605 --> 40:27.605
Please let me out.

618
40:35.715 --> 40:37.615
Getting carsick is so uncool.

619
40:47.695 --> 40:49.625
Why am I always like this in cars?

620
40:52.265 --> 40:54.895
But it is really cheap of him to threaten to cancel the contract.

621
40:56.565 --> 40:57.565
Hong Du?

622
40:58.875 --> 40:59.875
What?

623
41:01.975 --> 41:02.975
Hello.

624
41:05.445 --> 41:06.715
Drink this.

625
41:06.775 --> 41:09.215
Chamomile is good for settling your stomach.

626
41:09.285 --> 41:11.185
Thank you.

627
41:11.245 --> 41:13.555
But it is uncomfortable if you keep being so formal.

628
41:13.615 --> 41:15.655
You are much older than me.

629
41:15.725 --> 41:18.025
Shall I, then?

630
41:18.085 --> 41:21.625
I was really surprised earlier. How did you know my name?

631
41:21.695 --> 41:24.965
Oh, when you came to our shop that day.

632
41:26.265 --> 41:30.165
By the way, did you already know Tae Bong?

633
41:30.235 --> 41:33.335
Oh, with Han Jung Woo...

634
41:33.405 --> 41:35.205
No, with Um Tae Bong...

635
41:35.275 --> 41:37.105
No, no, Han Jung Woo...

636
41:37.175 --> 41:38.775
Anyway, with that jerk...

637
41:38.845 --> 41:42.285
Keep this in mind. The contract with me is an absolute secret.

638
41:44.245 --> 41:46.015
We are nothing to each other.

639
41:46.085 --> 41:47.555
Oh, really?

640
41:48.685 --> 41:50.825
You two looked close last time I saw you.

641
41:50.885 --> 41:52.325
Oh, that is...

642
41:54.325 --> 41:57.725
Actually, I am his body...

643
41:57.795 --> 42:00.695
Do not forget. If you break it, you pay ten times the penalty.

644
42:01.795 --> 42:04.265
I'm not just an average fan...

645
42:04.335 --> 42:05.935
I am a huge fan.

646
42:10.105 --> 42:12.245
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard Information)

647
42:14.075 --> 42:16.615
Oh, right, what about your family?

648
42:16.685 --> 42:20.815
Up until middle school, it was just me and my father,

649
42:20.885 --> 42:23.385
but in high school, with my stepmother and sisters,

650
42:23.455 --> 42:25.355
it became 4 women and 1 man.

651
42:25.425 --> 42:28.055
- What? - Oh, my.

652
42:28.125 --> 42:30.465
Was it always 4 kimchi stews and 1 soft tofu stew?

653
42:30.525 --> 42:32.195
I guess I just got used to saying things like that.

654
42:33.465 --> 42:36.535
Actually, I was the queen of part-time jobs.

655
42:36.605 --> 42:39.605
Your father must be very proud.

656
42:39.675 --> 42:41.535
If he were here, he would have scolded me a lot...

657
42:41.605 --> 42:43.975
for working to earn money instead of studying.

658
42:44.045 --> 42:47.345
Oh, I am sorry.

659
42:47.415 --> 42:48.915
Oh, it is fine.

660
42:48.985 --> 42:51.785
He is coming to visit tomorrow anyway.

661
42:51.845 --> 42:53.285
It is the anniversary of his death.

662
42:54.285 --> 42:58.225
(Her father's sudden death made Cha Hong Du Part-Time Queen...)

663
42:59.895 --> 43:01.155
That is all from the drama.

664
43:03.125 --> 43:05.065
She said she is a fan of Um Tae Bong,

665
43:05.125 --> 43:07.495
so is she imitating the tragic heroine?

666
43:08.905 --> 43:13.075
Oh, Song Na Ri, have you finally become a decent human being?

667
43:13.135 --> 43:15.345
Coming out to support the writer on your day off.

668
43:15.405 --> 43:16.705
But why are you really here?

669
43:16.775 --> 43:18.275
You probably did not just come to bring me coffee.

670
43:19.575 --> 43:22.945
Is the ending for this one sad too?

671
43:23.015 --> 43:25.115
Does someone die this time too?

672
43:25.185 --> 43:26.185
Well...

673
43:27.215 --> 43:28.455
Why?

674
43:28.515 --> 43:30.085
Do you want the two of them to have a happy ending?

675
43:32.025 --> 43:33.995
No, it is just that if it happens in the drama,

676
43:34.055 --> 43:36.295
I feel like it will happen in real life too.

677
43:37.395 --> 43:39.095
Writer Pyo,

678
43:39.165 --> 43:42.235
I really like Tae Bong.

679
43:44.705 --> 43:47.235
Oh, go ahead, who is stopping you?

680
43:48.675 --> 43:49.705
So...

681
43:52.415 --> 43:56.185
It hurts right here, like my heart is completely tattered.

682
43:56.245 --> 43:59.615
Oh my, you are way too immersed in this.

683
43:59.685 --> 44:01.155
Just like in the drama,

684
44:03.085 --> 44:04.855
I want to be in love in real life too.

685
44:07.655 --> 44:10.295
I should not say this as a writer, but...

686
44:10.365 --> 44:12.735
you need to distinguish between reality and the drama world.

687
44:20.005 --> 44:22.945
Reality is harsh, but dramas are sweet and nice.

688
44:24.945 --> 44:27.445
Even so, if you just lose yourself in them,

689
44:27.515 --> 44:29.615
you will get trapped in a fake world of your own making,

690
44:29.685 --> 44:31.345
and you might end up getting hurt.

691
44:36.185 --> 44:38.455
But it would be a relief if you were the only one crying.

692
44:38.525 --> 44:41.855
It is sad because the people you love will get hurt too.

693
44:45.595 --> 44:47.435
Why would I?

694
44:47.495 --> 44:50.035
Oh, forget it! My gosh.

695
44:55.845 --> 45:00.345
Wow, this is amazing. Is this the new car BK sent?

696
45:00.415 --> 45:01.445
Hold it right there.

697
45:03.415 --> 45:05.985
If you put your butt on my Ddabong,

698
45:06.055 --> 45:08.715
I will kick your butt.

699
45:10.485 --> 45:12.155
Ddabong? What is Ddabong?

700
45:12.225 --> 45:13.955
It is Tae Bong's younger sibling, so it is Ddabong.

701
45:14.025 --> 45:17.895
Right, oh, so you are only going to let women ride in it?

702
45:17.965 --> 45:22.365
Well, my father always says that when a man gets a new car,

703
45:22.435 --> 45:25.805
he absolutely has to let a woman ride in it first.

704
45:25.875 --> 45:27.775
He said it prevents accidents or something.

705
45:30.745 --> 45:32.515
- Really? - Yes.

706
45:34.475 --> 45:37.385
(Tae Bong)

707
45:40.655 --> 45:42.885
(We Have Noodles)

708
45:43.885 --> 45:44.885
Hello.

709
45:48.355 --> 45:50.995
Why are you answering Hyun Joo's phone?

710
45:51.065 --> 45:52.135
She is busy, why?

711
45:53.735 --> 45:54.995
Oh, she is busy?

712
45:55.065 --> 45:56.435
We have a group reservation. What is it?

713
45:56.505 --> 45:58.765
Oh, I just called. Why?

714
45:58.835 --> 46:00.305
Oh, man.

715
46:00.375 --> 46:02.205
Hello...

716
46:02.275 --> 46:03.275
What was that?

717
46:04.345 --> 46:06.245
Who was it?

718
46:06.315 --> 46:07.815
Oh, it was Tae Bong.

719
46:09.345 --> 46:10.345
Was he looking for me?

720
46:11.585 --> 46:14.055
No, he probably called because my phone was off.

721
46:17.425 --> 46:19.755
We do not have any reservations today, so should we close early?

722
46:21.355 --> 46:22.365
Should we?

723
46:23.665 --> 46:24.665
Hyun Joo?

724
46:36.175 --> 46:37.245
Darn it.

725
46:41.775 --> 46:43.315
(Na Ri)

726
46:44.315 --> 46:45.315
Darn it.

727
46:57.825 --> 46:59.335
Tae Bong.

728
46:59.395 --> 47:00.465
Darn it!

729
47:00.535 --> 47:02.265
Did you really answer my call, Tae Bong?

730
47:03.535 --> 47:06.375
Tae Bong, hello? Tae Bong?

731
47:09.605 --> 47:10.605
Tae Bong?

732
47:12.075 --> 47:13.715
Tell me about it.

733
47:13.775 --> 47:15.985
My stupid toe.

734
47:17.245 --> 47:18.985
I wanted to give you something,

735
47:19.055 --> 47:21.385
so I packed a really delicious lunch box.

736
47:21.455 --> 47:22.785
Is that so?

737
47:22.855 --> 47:25.355
Yes, I am in your neighbourhood right now.

738
47:26.595 --> 47:29.365
Oh, really? I am in your neighbourhood right now.

739
47:29.425 --> 47:30.425
Really?

740
47:30.495 --> 47:33.895
So you need to hurry back. Right now, this instant.

741
47:33.965 --> 47:35.135
Okay, I will be right there.

742
47:37.365 --> 47:39.105
What?

743
47:39.175 --> 47:41.935
But how does he know where I live?

744
47:42.005 --> 47:44.275
Because of what Su Dong said,

745
47:44.345 --> 47:46.075
I feel bad not giving anyone a ride.

746
47:48.845 --> 47:51.945
No, I need some time to myself right now.

747
47:52.015 --> 47:55.955
Do you seriously not have a single woman to ride shotgun with you?

748
47:56.025 --> 47:59.555
Hey, I do. She is petite, very shy,

749
47:59.625 --> 48:04.065
- and says okay to whatever I say. - That is good then. Goodbye.

750
48:12.575 --> 48:14.875
Gosh, I know.

751
48:14.935 --> 48:17.175
You must be dumbfounded to suddenly become a woman.

752
48:18.705 --> 48:20.875
Okay, I am sorry.

753
48:21.915 --> 48:24.785
But it is nice to go for a drive, right?

754
48:24.845 --> 48:25.855
Right?

755
48:27.315 --> 48:29.055
Unbelievable.

756
48:29.125 --> 48:30.425
I cannot believe I brought this thing along.

757
48:33.155 --> 48:34.155
Go over there.

758
48:54.275 --> 48:57.315
I ran all the way from home to get to you quickly, Jung Woo.

759
48:59.615 --> 49:01.055
Shall we get started then?

760
49:01.115 --> 49:03.025
Yes.

761
49:03.085 --> 49:04.185
Yes, good. Now, straight ahead.

762
49:04.255 --> 49:06.355
Just keep going like that. Do not touch anything,

763
49:07.525 --> 49:10.065
relax your arms, and just look straight ahead.

764
49:10.125 --> 49:11.565
- Good, good, good. - Like this?

765
49:11.565 --> 49:12.565
Good. You're doing great.

766
49:12.565 --> 49:16.035
- Wait, wait. Hold on. - You are doing great.

767
49:19.335 --> 49:21.975
Good, you are doing great. Now. Now, just move your legs.

768
49:22.035 --> 49:25.605
Good. Here we go. You are doing great, good.

769
49:25.675 --> 49:26.675
Excellent.

770
49:40.055 --> 49:41.995
Look ahead. It is okay, you can do this.

771
49:42.055 --> 49:43.425
- Do not let go. - I will not.

772
49:43.495 --> 49:45.025
Seriously, do not let go.

773
49:45.025 --> 49:46.065
- Good, you're doing great. - Seriously, don't let go.

774
49:46.065 --> 49:47.135
You're doing great.

775
49:47.195 --> 49:48.195
Do not let go.

776
49:48.265 --> 49:49.705
I will not.

777
49:49.765 --> 49:51.965
Now, you are doing it, you are doing it.

778
49:52.035 --> 49:54.805
I told you not to let go, okay?

779
49:56.775 --> 49:57.975
You did it, Hong Du.

780
49:59.545 --> 50:01.015
What?

781
50:01.075 --> 50:02.075
Oh, I'm doing it.

782
50:39.715 --> 50:42.015
Man, what have you been doing all these years?

783
50:42.085 --> 50:43.925
You didn't even learn how to ride a bike from your dad.

784
50:50.895 --> 50:52.735
I mean...

785
50:52.795 --> 50:54.495
You said he passed away, right?

786
50:57.635 --> 51:00.105
And the rest of your family passed away then too?

787
51:10.315 --> 51:11.545
Wow, I mean,

788
51:11.615 --> 51:13.255
saying you're on the same level as Cinderella...

789
51:13.315 --> 51:14.485
is this how you bring it up?

790
51:15.755 --> 51:17.585
What, in terms of beauty?

791
51:18.985 --> 51:20.695
And who's on your level for being full of yourself?

792
51:23.925 --> 51:26.435
You're making me really miss my dad, Jung Woo.

793
51:31.835 --> 51:32.835
All right, fine.

794
51:33.975 --> 51:35.775
I'll do it for you.

795
51:35.845 --> 51:36.845
Be your dad.

796
51:39.375 --> 51:41.475
The things a dad does for his daughters,

797
51:41.545 --> 51:42.585
I'll do them for you.

798
51:43.985 --> 51:46.455
I taught you how to ride a bike today.

799
51:46.515 --> 51:47.515
What else is there?

800
51:51.055 --> 51:53.225
Will you teach me how to drink, too?

801
51:53.295 --> 51:56.225
I've never tried it because I'm always working part-time.

802
51:56.295 --> 51:57.295
Sure, why not.

803
51:57.365 --> 52:00.095
Oh, what about driving? How to drive?

804
52:00.165 --> 52:01.695
I didn't use to be like this,

805
52:01.765 --> 52:04.135
but lately, I get carsick whenever I get in a car.

806
52:04.205 --> 52:05.465
I'm down for that, too.

807
52:05.535 --> 52:07.405
Oh, what else is there? What else?

808
52:07.475 --> 52:11.005
Oh, if I get a boyfriend, drinking with him and saying,

809
52:11.075 --> 52:14.045
"Don't make my daughter cry." That too?

810
52:16.145 --> 52:18.815
Come on, you should do that too.

811
52:18.885 --> 52:21.215
Why? Do you hate the idea of me seeing other guys?

812
52:35.535 --> 52:36.605
What kind of person...

813
52:37.665 --> 52:38.665
was your dad, Hong Du?

814
52:43.205 --> 52:45.005
When he got off work...

815
52:45.075 --> 52:47.345
he was the one who hugged me first.

816
52:47.415 --> 52:48.615
Chairman, are you back?

817
52:52.145 --> 52:53.455
The young lady is still awake.

818
53:05.665 --> 53:06.665
I'll see her later.

819
53:08.295 --> 53:10.205
And he was someone who constantly worried...

820
53:10.265 --> 53:12.905
that I might pass away early like my mom,

821
53:14.135 --> 53:16.375
so he never stopped worrying about me.

822
53:17.605 --> 53:20.115
Prepare for the funeral quietly.

823
53:21.915 --> 53:22.945
Just because I go...

824
53:25.485 --> 53:26.715
it won't bring her back.

825
53:29.115 --> 53:30.855
I'm so glad...

826
53:32.325 --> 53:33.325
that my dad was my dad.

827
53:36.025 --> 53:37.225
Oh, right.

828
53:37.295 --> 53:39.365
If you don't have plans later tonight, come over to my place.

829
53:39.435 --> 53:41.335
What's the occasion?

830
53:41.395 --> 53:43.535
I'll tell you if you lend me the bike.

831
53:43.605 --> 53:44.635
I need a porter.

832
53:48.805 --> 53:49.805
Here.

833
53:52.545 --> 53:53.675
Yes!

834
54:08.925 --> 54:10.565
It's a dinner date with my dad.

835
54:14.365 --> 54:15.965
She's a new kind of bike thief.

836
54:25.445 --> 54:28.975
(The Late Tae Min Seok)

837
54:32.285 --> 54:33.285
I'm here.

838
54:35.915 --> 54:38.255
I got a new car, and the only place I came to show it off...

839
54:39.625 --> 54:40.625
is here.

840
54:42.325 --> 54:44.165
I wanted to come with Hyun Joo.

841
54:45.195 --> 54:48.165
Would you have hated that?

842
55:02.245 --> 55:04.285
Let's just stay here until this melts.

843
55:14.595 --> 55:15.595
Actually...

844
55:18.565 --> 55:20.935
there was something I wanted to ask you when I came.

845
55:21.665 --> 55:22.665
(Dream Star Art Academy)

846
55:25.705 --> 55:26.705
By any chance...

847
55:28.475 --> 55:29.875
did you meet that kid up there?

848
55:32.405 --> 55:33.415
If you did,

849
55:37.615 --> 55:38.615
could you tell her something for me?

850
55:44.185 --> 55:45.625
That I miss her sometimes.

851
55:51.165 --> 55:52.165
But...

852
55:56.505 --> 55:57.635
Strangely enough,

853
56:00.335 --> 56:02.135
I can't remember her face.

854
56:03.145 --> 56:04.805
So, if you met her,

855
56:08.415 --> 56:09.785
ask her for me.

856
56:11.515 --> 56:13.155
Ask if she still hates me.

857
56:16.485 --> 56:17.485
And...

858
56:18.625 --> 56:19.925
tell her for me.

859
56:22.625 --> 56:23.965
That I am...

860
56:31.705 --> 56:32.875
so incredibly sorry.

861
57:13.815 --> 57:14.815
What the?

862
57:31.895 --> 57:33.365
Right.

863
57:33.365 --> 57:37.905
I'm only calling her because I absolutely have to.

864
57:43.775 --> 57:47.445
Wait, Cha Hong Du doesn't have a phone.

865
57:47.515 --> 57:49.615
Then how am I supposed to contact her? Darn it.

866
57:51.285 --> 57:52.485
Seriously.

867
57:55.555 --> 57:58.655
My dad is going to be so full after eating all this.

868
57:58.725 --> 58:01.155
- Here you go. - Oh, thank you.

869
58:02.625 --> 58:06.165
(Angang Handmade Dumplings)

870
58:13.235 --> 58:14.705
Man.

871
58:14.775 --> 58:16.405
I can't believe I'm buying her something like this.

872
58:20.045 --> 58:21.045
Gosh, that scared me!

873
58:22.215 --> 58:23.215
That scared me.

874
58:25.815 --> 58:28.415
Cha Hong Du? Darn it.

875
58:30.885 --> 58:32.255
You can't just pop out of nowhere like that.

876
58:33.495 --> 58:34.495
Darn it.

877
58:37.265 --> 58:38.495
What is his problem?

878
58:42.735 --> 58:45.405
What do you think of the car? Pretty killer, right?

879
58:45.465 --> 58:47.205
Today is my first time driving it.

880
58:52.205 --> 58:55.215
Okay, okay. I'll take you for a spin.

881
58:55.275 --> 58:56.285
I don't really want to.

882
58:59.785 --> 59:01.455
I have other cars at home, too.

883
59:02.685 --> 59:04.125
You've been to my house before, right?

884
59:04.185 --> 59:05.955
Oh, did you not see the garage?

885
59:07.695 --> 59:11.495
Wow. That is so cool.

886
59:12.795 --> 59:13.795
Happy now?

887
59:19.235 --> 59:20.235
Hold on.

888
59:33.715 --> 59:36.685
It is inconvenient for me if my bodyguard doesn't have a phone.

889
59:36.755 --> 59:37.755
I already activated it.

890
59:43.465 --> 59:44.465
What are you doing?

891
59:44.525 --> 59:46.395
- Won't you save my number? - I'll do it later.

892
59:46.465 --> 59:48.395
Why later? Do it now.

893
59:48.465 --> 59:49.665
I can do what I want.

894
59:49.735 --> 59:52.205
Why did you come all the way here just to pick a fight?

895
59:52.265 --> 59:54.105
Today is the anniversary of my dad's death,

896
59:54.175 --> 59:56.035
so I am really holding back, okay?

897
59:56.105 --> 59:57.105
Today is...

898
01:00:01.515 --> 01:00:02.775
Oh, so that's why...

899
01:00:05.015 --> 01:00:06.485
Well, what, did you think...

900
01:00:06.555 --> 01:00:09.285
I bought all this just to eat by myself?

901
01:00:12.555 --> 01:00:13.725
What about your family?

902
01:00:15.125 --> 01:00:16.525
Is there anyone to keep you company...

903
01:00:16.595 --> 01:00:18.095
Aren't you busy?

904
01:00:18.165 --> 01:00:19.895
I am incredibly busy.

905
01:00:19.965 --> 01:00:21.835
I have to hurry up and set the table for my dad.

906
01:00:52.395 --> 01:00:55.065
Oh, wow.

907
01:00:55.135 --> 01:00:56.535
Yes!

908
01:01:03.045 --> 01:01:06.045
(Stop)

909
01:01:23.825 --> 01:01:24.825
What?

910
01:01:24.895 --> 01:01:26.965
(Stop)

911
01:01:29.165 --> 01:01:32.135
(Stop)

912
01:02:19.185 --> 01:02:20.185
What's wrong with her?

913
01:02:47.145 --> 01:02:49.415
- Are you crazy? Do you want to die? - Let go of me.

914
01:02:49.475 --> 01:02:50.515
Snap out of it, Cha Hong Du!

915
01:02:53.815 --> 01:02:55.555
It was my dad.

916
01:02:55.615 --> 01:02:58.525
I saw my dad!

917
01:02:58.585 --> 01:03:03.125
- What? - It really was my father.

918
01:03:11.765 --> 01:03:13.575
Hong Du, here you are.

919
01:03:15.835 --> 01:03:17.375
What is it?

920
01:03:17.445 --> 01:03:18.745
You must be cold.

921
01:03:33.755 --> 01:03:34.855
Is it that good?

922
01:03:35.995 --> 01:03:37.265
Good enough to eat while crying?

923
01:03:38.765 --> 01:03:40.735
I love tteokbokki more than anything in the world.

924
01:03:42.295 --> 01:03:43.305
More than your father?

925
01:03:44.905 --> 01:03:45.905
Yes.

926
01:03:48.275 --> 01:03:50.045
Should I tell your stepmother...

927
01:03:50.105 --> 01:03:52.175
and your sisters to just leave?

928
01:03:52.245 --> 01:03:55.245
You cry like this every day when I am not around.

929
01:03:57.045 --> 01:03:59.845
If you do not like them, I will just tell them to leave.

930
01:03:59.915 --> 01:04:02.085
But then you would be lonely.

931
01:04:05.485 --> 01:04:09.325
They say adults need a partner. Otherwise, they get lonely.

932
01:04:10.595 --> 01:04:13.165
And it is also because of the smell.

933
01:04:13.235 --> 01:04:14.365
The smell?

934
01:04:14.435 --> 01:04:17.105
They say men who live alone for a long time start to smell.

935
01:04:17.165 --> 01:04:18.165
Is that so?

936
01:04:21.935 --> 01:04:23.575
Do I smell bad?

937
01:04:23.645 --> 01:04:25.445
Yes, a lot.

938
01:04:29.985 --> 01:04:31.285
Father smell.

939
01:04:38.685 --> 01:04:39.825
A good one.

940
01:04:55.805 --> 01:04:58.645
I wonder if my teacher is doing well.

941
01:05:01.145 --> 01:05:04.415
My acting was amazing back then.

942
01:05:11.125 --> 01:05:14.255
Hong Du, do you want to go on a date with your father?

943
01:05:14.325 --> 01:05:16.925
It really was my father.

944
01:05:18.325 --> 01:05:20.635
My daughter, Hong Du.

945
01:05:20.695 --> 01:05:24.305
The best thing I ever did in my life...

946
01:05:24.365 --> 01:05:26.905
was becoming your father.

947
01:05:26.975 --> 01:05:28.875
Han Jung Woo.

948
01:05:28.935 --> 01:05:29.935
No, Um Tae Bong.

949
01:05:31.075 --> 01:05:34.715
Please, please find my father.

950
01:05:36.715 --> 01:05:38.715
She, who seemed like a complete lie,

951
01:05:39.945 --> 01:05:42.685
and her world, which seemed like a lie,

952
01:05:42.755 --> 01:05:44.425
spoke to me just like that.

953
01:05:47.555 --> 01:05:49.325
Asking me to enter her world.

954
01:05:51.625 --> 01:05:53.335
Laughing and crying,

955
01:05:54.565 --> 01:05:56.805
even if it might lead to a sad ending.

956
01:06:00.635 --> 01:06:02.805
That day, when we captured each other in our eyes.

957
01:06:06.605 --> 01:06:08.315
Even if we might end up falling in love.

958
01:06:18.585 --> 01:06:21.495
(Oh! My Guard)
